          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jo ma gilonnye kekengi doŋ me bedo leŋ me cito i potti, kun gilubo dano mo ma tye i dyere, ma gicamo riŋo opego ki gin mogo me kwer ki oyoo adeŋ-gu, gin ducu gibitum woko kacel dok lawaŋacel,” man Rwot ma owaco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pien aŋeyo ticgi ki tamgi, abibino me coko rok ducu ma loko leb maptpat kacel; gin gibibino ci gineno deyona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abiketo lanyut i kingi. Abikwanyo jo mubwot ki i kingi kenyo, abicwalogi bot lurok, bot jo Tarcic, Put ki Lud, ma gin jo ma gitelo atum, bot jo Tubal ki Javan, ki i lobo ma tye i dog nam ka mabor, ma pud peya guwinyo kit ma nyiŋa oywek kwede, kadi neno deyona i kin lurok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gibikelo utmegigi ki i rok ducu macalo gityer me atyera bot Rwot, kun gikelogi ki aguragura, gadigadi, kitara, kana ki kinaga-gu wa i wi got mera maleŋ ma tye i Jerucalem, kit macalo jo Icrael kelo kwede gityergi me moko kwon i atabo maleŋ i ot pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abikwanyo jo mukene i kingi bene me bedo ajwagi ki Lulevi, man Rwot ma owaco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
